[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8281.429, "timestamp": "02:18:01", "text": "与我一起？我必须拿着它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8283.669, "timestamp": "02:18:03", "text": "不，你不需要有好的爱好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8284.709, "timestamp": "02:18:04", "text": "这就是为什么我总是想到“像”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8285.91, "timestamp": "02:18:05", "text": "拿起手机，然后去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8288.15, "timestamp": "02:18:08", "text": "咖啡。我觉得我好像见过一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8290.549, "timestamp": "02:18:10", "text": "有些人会录下自己的视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8293.19, "timestamp": "02:18:13", "text": "出去做些户外活动之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8294.629, "timestamp": "02:18:14", "text": "你还能听到背景声音，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8295.91, "timestamp": "02:18:15", "text": "然后就感觉好像……哦，原来如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8298.469, "timestamp": "02:18:18", "text": "自然的，或许就是这样。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8300.629, "timestamp": "02:18:20", "text": "就像，哦，这个人出局了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8302.709, "timestamp": "02:18:22", "text": "因此，就像我能理解我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8304.99, "timestamp": "02:18:24", "text": "质量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8310.77, "timestamp": "02:18:30", "text": "啊哦，好的好的，这样可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8312.83, "timestamp": "02:18:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8322.15, "timestamp": "02:18:42", "text": "是的，我想我在P ComicCon期间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8325.469, "timestamp": "02:18:45", "text": "我想我的确带了那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8329.19, "timestamp": "02:18:49", "text": "嗯，就是那个麦克风之类的东西，对吧？是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8331.91, "timestamp": "02:18:51", "text": "是的。是的。我可以用到它。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8334.15, "timestamp": "02:18:54", "text": "嗯。最好把它放在身边，因为我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8335.83, "timestamp": "02:18:55", "text": "距离远的时候，就不是这样了。"}]